月向美国广告主开放 ChatGPT Ads Manager 自助服务，取消 $50,000 最低消费并支持 CPC 竞价。9 月起购物结果需连接产品 Feed，广告扩展至欧洲等地。鉴于公开成本基准稀缺且预估 CPC 为 $3-$5，建议具备完善追踪与高客单价的品牌以固定预算小规模测试。",{"_118":119},"2026-10-02T19:31:50.000Z",[195,165,115],40,{"_110":111,"_112":113},[427],{"_96":97,"_98":428,"_100":429,"_102":430,"_104":105,"_106":107,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/d37d5d0893a894c4.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/d37d5d0893a894c4.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/d37d5d0893a894c4.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/d37d5d0893a894c4.webp 720w","mm01j733gtq5lq30van8wxejv","Google AI Mode 购物广告与结账：Merchant Center 操作要点","原文来自 SellerElevate，该机构在文末推广其免费账户审计与 Google Ads 管理服务，存在相关商业利益，并非独立测评。原文称：Shopping 广告自 2026 年 2 月 11 日起出现在 Google AI Mode，标注为赞助，由已连接 Merchant Center 的现有 Shopping 和 Performance Max 广告系列投放，无需单独选择加入；AI Mode 内的结账基于 Google 的通用商务协议（UCP），仅限美国，面向符合资格并被选中的商家，需在 Merchant Center 商品 Feed 中添加 native_commerce 属性并提交意向表，商家仍为记录卖家，退货与客户关系归商家，付款通过 Google Pay，支付服务商需支持 Google Pay token。原文提醒部分功能仍标注为早期访问，行动前应在 Merchant Center 和 Google Ads 中确认日期与资格。",{"_118":119},"2026-10-02T19:41:50.000Z",[195,116,115],{"_110":111,"_112":113},[439],{"_96":97,"_98":440,"_100":441,"_102":442,"_104":105,"_106":107,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/7c25894664a3414a.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/7c25894664a3414a.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/7c25894664a3414a.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/7c25894664a3414a.webp 720w","vhuu3tqno1h62euyvkx2erxp1","Shopify 推出 Agentic Storefronts：支持在 ChatGPT、Gemini 和 Copilot 销售","Shopify 于 2026 年 3 月 24 日上线 Agentic Storefronts，默认向符合条件的店铺开放，通过 Shopify Catalog 将产品同步至 ChatGPT、Gemini、Copilot 及 Google AI Mode。",{"_118":119},"2026-10-02T19:51:50.000Z",[195,196,116],{"_110":111,"_112":113},[451],{"_96":97,"_98":452,"_100":453,"_102":454,"_104":105,"_106":107,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/e7eae92f2b9baf01.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/e7eae92f2b9baf01.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/e7eae92f2b9baf01.webp 336w, /